 r←Test_Misc_030(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;config;successFlag;msg
⍝ Exercise `PerformConfigChecks`: an invalid Tatin dependency folder must be reported under the right key.
⍝ With an empty "dependencies.tatin", a problem in "dependencies_dev.tatin" used to be reported as "dependencies".
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 config←∆GetConfigForChecks'packages_dev=A=B'
 config.CIDER.dependencies.tatin←''
 (successFlag msg)←##.Cider.PerformConfigChecks config
 →T.PassesIf 0≡successFlag
 →T.PassesIf∨/'"dependencies_dev"'⍷msg

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
